  "title": "Whole Roasted Cauliflower with Smoked Paprika",
  "description": "Roasting a whole cauliflower with a smoked paprika rub is an easy, flavorful way to serve a vegetable main dish to any vegetarian or vegan dinner guests.",
  "authors": [
